      SUBROUTINE  RELTVY (Q1,Q2,Q3,SW3)                                 RLV 001 
C     ORIGINALLY WRITTEN BY FRED HERZFELD (RCA)  FALL 1961              RLV 002 
C     MODIFIED BY RICHARD KORTUM   FALL 1962                            RLV 003 
      DIMENSION X(521),T(521),P(521),DT(521),DP(521),ARG(521),B(521),   RLV 004 
     1Z(9),NLL(9),NL(20),HEAD(12),EQ(7,9,19),ENL(9,19),INL(9,19),       RLV 005 
     2MNL(9,19),EMAXV(19),IMAXV(19),SF(9),QP1(521),QP2(521),QP3(521)    RLV 006 
     3,DDP(521),BIN(42)                                                 RLV 007 
